        "date": "2026-11-22T11:28:33Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): Pass starts at (Auto/Inside/Outside) for 2D Adaptive\n\n2D Adaptive takes the shared pass_start field of #3316: same type,\nproject key, Passes-tab row and MCP door. Auto keeps every earlier\npath byte for byte.\n\nOutside cuts each piece from the air past the stock edge (the #1950\nair plan); a piece with no air side makes the Offset rings cut the\narea from its outer edge in, named in the notes. Inside grows from the\ncore of a pocket without holes (the growth plan); an area with holes\nis cut by Offset rings from the hole wall out, named. The Trochoidal\nmethod refuses Inside and Outside by name (command door, generator,\nconsequence line).\n\nStacked on #3353.\n\nFixes #3355\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
