      "message": "Merge main into issue/3355-adaptive-pass-start (pocket_hsm.rs: keep both sides)\n\nThe one conflicted hunk: the Err(why) fallback note arms of\nadaptive_ordered. Keep the pass-start arms of the branch, route every\nfallback note through main's RINGS_FALLBACK (issue #3035), so\nrings_fallbacks() counts the pass-start fallback too and the op raises\nWarning::StrategyFallback. The maintainer decided this resolution\n(WARN) for #3402.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
