      "message": "fix(2d): the pass-start rings fallback warns (#3035)\n\npocket_hsm_start::rings() said the switch in a note that\nrings_fallbacks() cannot see: \"; Offset rings cut ... in that order\ninstead\" carries neither the RINGS_FALLBACK words nor the counted\nform, so the op posted no warning. Route the note through\nRINGS_FALLBACK like every other fallback note, and update the\nadaptive_pass_start pins: the Outside and Inside fig8 cases now carry\none StrategyFallback warning and the \"Pass starts at\" note. The\nmaintainer decided this for #3402 (WARN).\n\nRefs #3355\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
