      "message": "fix(test): set pass_start in the playback bench params\n\nThe #3355 field is new on OpParams::Adaptive2D. The playback bench\nbuilt the variant from scratch, so clippy --all-targets refused it.\nThe quick gate builds only the test targets that its diff picks, so\nit did not see this file. Set the field to the default (Auto), as\nthe other full initializers in the tests do.\n\nRefs #3355\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
