      "message": "fix(2d): keep the adaptive pass start through the Face pass start merge\n\nMerge origin/main fdda55e15 (#3387, the Face pass start). One conflict,\nin crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/pass_start.rs: keep main's Face no-order\ntest and the branch's Trochoidal refusal test, with both imports. No\nother file needed a hand edit.\n\nThe #3355 resolution of the previous merge stands: main's StartSide,\npocket_started_on, ring_plan for every non-Adaptive arm, and the\nretargeted Inside pin.\n\nRefs #3355\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
